00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:01.840 line:95% align:center position:50%
Let your left elbow rise toward the sky.

00:30:01.960 --> 00:30:04.280 line:95% align:center position:50%
I see some of you raising your
right elbow. Raise your left elbow.

00:30:04.440 --> 00:30:06.400 line:95% align:center position:50%
Don't hit your neighbor.

00:30:07.200 --> 00:30:09.520 line:95% align:center position:50%
Let your left arm extend.

00:30:09.680 --> 00:30:11.360 line:95% align:center position:50%
At this point, there shouldn't
be much danger anymore.

00:30:11.480 --> 00:30:14.120 line:95% align:center position:50%
And place your right hand
somewhere on the chair.

00:30:14.880 --> 00:30:19.120 line:95% align:center position:50%
Let your entire left side stretch out,
and let your head turn slightly

00:30:19.200 --> 00:30:25.040 line:95% align:center position:50%
Move to the left and inhale to feel the
